      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しばらくは再開できそうにないみたいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なかなか大ごとになったな……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、機材トラブルじゃ仕方ないよな\r\n今のうちに体を休めておこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おー……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "対応してくれてるスタッフの人たちには悪いけど……\r\nそうさせてもらう",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ブランケットもあるし、\r\n少し眠っててもいいんだぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "長丁場の撮影で、疲れてるだろうし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずっと衣装でいるのが大変だったら\r\n着替えても──",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "大丈夫だって\r\nまたセットしてもらうほうが大変だし……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "大体、それを言うなら\r\nプロデューサーこそ休んだらどうだ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "朝も早かったんだろ？\r\n今もあちこち走り回ってるし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──最後に座ったのなんていつだよ\r\nほら、アンタがソファ使えって",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、俺は大丈夫だよ\r\nそれより樹里のほうが──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシも大丈夫だって、\r\n体力はある方だし",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "だから、アンタこそ──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030101,
    "speaker": "樹里＆プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030101"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ははっ\r\nいつまで経っても終わらねーな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n……でも本当に、無理はしないようにな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おい、また堂々巡りが始まるぞー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "でも、アタシも言わせてもらう\r\n……アンタも、無理すんじゃねーぞ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "体調管理も\r\n俺の仕事だ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "…………\r\n無理はしないよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "樹里は優しいな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルが万全の状態で、最高の仕事ができるように",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それがプロデューサーの仕事だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、俺のためにも、\r\n樹里はしっかり休んで再開に備えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……わかったよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──じゃあ、ちょっとだけ休ませてもらうから……\r\n……アンタも、ちゃんと休めよな",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もちろんだ\r\n樹里を心配させることはしないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "その言葉、覚えたからな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ちゃんと守れよ、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030170"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──変な間があったな",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ\r\n大人だし、自分の限界くらいは──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "だからその！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030200,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "限界までやろうとすんのが\r\nそもそもおかしいんだっつーの",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030210,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それでもって言うんなら──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はづきさんにでも社長にでも言いつけて\r\n無理矢理にでもアンタを休ませるからな！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……そんくらいしないと、\r\nアンタ休まないだろ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\nそう言われるとな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030240,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "少しくらい……自分の心配もしろよな",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030250,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "仕事も大事だ、けどさ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030260,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "大事なもんは、\r\nそれだけじゃないんだから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030270,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……な？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
