  {
    "id": 2011009030280,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁっ！？\r\nなんで今それが出てくるんだよ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "思ったことを\r\n正直に言っただけだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに樹里が優しいのは、\r\nみんな知ってることだ",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030290,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "みんなって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100903/2011009030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里の優しいところなら、いくらでも言えるぞ\r\n例えば──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009030300,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いいって……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
